WEBVTT

00:00:29.042 --> 00:00:31.876
Now, by "illegal trading" --

00:00:33.686 --> 00:00:39.903
he was selling clogs, sugar,
rice and later copper

00:00:39.927 --> 00:00:41.339
to feed us.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:49.658
In 2007, my sister and I
decided to escape.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.595
She was 16 years old,

00:00:52.619 --> 00:00:55.269
and I was 13 years old.

00:00:56.809 --> 00:01:01.916
I need you to understand
what the word "escape" means